<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>growth,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανεκλήθη ὡς ἐς φῦμα ζωῆς</span>
			<i>beginning of a fresh</i> life, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>: but usu., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>that which grows,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				136
			</span></i>; freq. of diseased growths, <i>tumour, tubercle,</i> etc.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.133
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				85c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.11.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Od.</u>
				59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).123.4
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦμα φύειν, φῦμα φύεται,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Archil.
			</span></i> l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῠμάτεσσι</span> only late,
				<i><span class="en">
				Marc.Sid.
				83
			</span></i>.]</div>
